		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Eyeless dragonkin that lairs in tar pits and oil sumps. Covered with slippery mucus.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +7 (2d8) or volatile breath, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to fire and lightning.</p><p></p><p><strong>Slippery</strong>. Cannot be entangled, slowed, or hindered.</p><p></p><p><strong>Volatile Breath</strong>. Hazy, sulfurous gas fills a double near-sized cube extending from targotha. WIS 15+ or confused for 1d4 rounds. If exposed to fire, gas explodes, DEX 15+ or 3d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
